The timetable (GTFS) and the real-time trip updates (GTFS-RT) come from the
open data of Lignes d'Azur, the public transport of the Métropole Nice Côte
d'Azur, published on
https://transport.data.gouv.fr/datasets/donnees-statiques-et-dynamiques-du-reseau-de-transport-lignes-dazur
under the Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab):
https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/. Source: Lignes
d'Azur, Métropole Nice Côte d'Azur. The widgets show the source (Lignes
d'Azur) and the time of each reading. The files under test/fixtures are
extracts of these data, kept under the same licence.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
Lignes d'Azur or the Métropole Nice Côte d'Azur.
